  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice pear into wedges. Cut firm tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm cubes. Grate carrot.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tofu and Chinese BBQ seasoning.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, sesame seeds and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e015a80501f0f3b91cdbfe-dc2e7b53.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, turning until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove from heat then add sweet chilli sauce mixture, tossing to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e015a80501f0f3b91cdbfe-fe1c08b1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine salad leaves, carrot, pear, a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e015a80501f0f3b91cdbfe-f3844654.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build tacos by spreading the mayonnaise over tortillas then filling with salad and tofu.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65e015a80501f0f3b91cdbfe-e96e1d32.jpeg"
    }
  ]
